items.description:
1. Build the overall worldview of the game according to the project requirements;
2. Integrate the scripts into the existing world view better, including but not limited to partially modifying the scripts, make fine adjustments of the world view, etc;
3. Responsible for the adaptation of the scripts, including but not limited to adding fictional plots to the original scripts, adapting the original scripts to a certain degree of gamification, adding or reducing dialogues to suit the pace of the game;
4. Responsible for the writing of in-game text content, such as dialogues,mission descriptions and other parts of copywriting;
5. Design the story which cooperates with the level gameplay, and improve the expressiveness of the level content.
