items.requirements:
1. Bachelor degree or above, preferably in literature, screenwriting, film, game design or a related field;
2. Excellent literature and storytelling skills;
3. At least 5 years working experience as a narrative designer;
4. Participate in at least one AAA project from 0 to 1 in a narrative designer role;
5. Passion for stories and games, especially story-driven AAA games and action games;
6. Familiarity with dialogue system;
7. Excellent communication skills and logical thinking.
Even Better If You Have:
1. Working experience with technical artists on dialogue system;
2. Familiarity with urban themes.
